    {
      "id": "a4-sticky",
      "name": "⚙️ Agent 4: Image Designer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Blog Agent 4: Image Designer v2\n\n**Trigger:** Every 5 min\n**Input:** blog_pipeline (status = copy_written)\n**Output:** Gemini Imagen 3 → Imgbb CDN URL → status = ready_to_publish\n\n**Image Model:** Imagen 3 via Gemini API (key hardcoded)\n**Hosting:** Imgbb free CDN (accepts base64 directly — no Code node needed)\n**Fallback:** If Gemini or Imgbb fails, publishes without cover image (pipeline continues)\n\n**Flow:**\nGemini success → Upload to Imgbb → Save Image URL (With Image)\nGemini error → Save Image URL (No Image)",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 380
      }
    }
